{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bunny Dusty</i> is all about being a bunny and figuring out who you really want to be. But this isn't your typical RPG, no. In <i>Bunny Dusty</i>, you'll have you use pure action to make permanent choices about the essence of your being.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small world that fits in your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprising abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuuming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic couplets for dialog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things this game DOES NOT HAVE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map or HUD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory or equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up (or down)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetary currencies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055480?t=1761348659","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055480?t=1761348659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055480/52e97517df99f96b453fe6b1a68d2f12709245e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761348659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055480/52e97517df99f96b453fe6b1a68d2f12709245e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761348659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon/fantasy violence involving weapons and blood which some viewers may find disturbing. This game contains references to alcohol which may not be suitable for